Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:02.80,Cartela,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,900)}Esta fita foi encontrada\Ndentro de uma árvore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tá gravando, Tião?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:07.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tá. Pode ir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:14.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em Capela do Sereno,\Na terra recusou um homem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:20.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Bateu na mãe.\NA terra cuspiu ele de volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:22.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Seco. Tá lá na figueira.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:23.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,— Já viu ele?\N— Todo dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tião, a bateria aguenta?\NMeia hora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:30.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,[as cigarras param]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:36.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:44.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É a varanda do seu Benedito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:49.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ele vê ele todo dia.\NNunca filmamos a cara dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:51.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Volta a fita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,[respiração]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:06.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,[galho estala]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:10.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Corre, Tião! Dudu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:21.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,[silêncio]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:26.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tião?
